# A Clan's Reputation (Q510), refused at the turn-in (#5167): the quest owner left the clan
# holding three claws. Valdis answers the not-a-leader page before anything is taken: the
# claws stay, no reputation is paid and the quest stays started on its step.
# Hand-written from the quest script (no reference trace): the reference takes the claws,
# then fails on the missing clan and answers nothing.
character Leader 40
quest Q510_AClansReputation <state>=STARTED <cond>=1
hold 8767 3
script quest.Q510_AClansReputation
item 8767
page villagemaster/31331.htm
page script/quest/Q510_AClansReputation/
npc valdis 31331 VillageMasterMystic 10 0 0

action valdis
action valdis
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=valdis item=0 page=villagemaster/31331.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{valdis}_Quest
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=valdis item=0 page=script/quest/Q510_AClansReputation/31331-0.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  items 8767=3
  state Q510_AClansReputation STARTED
  rows Q510_AClansReputation <cond>=1 <state>=STARTED
